Oh, yeah. I thought you would be.

00:49:53.930 --> 00:49:55.500
There was this girl named Lindsay.

00:49:55.500 --> 00:49:56.440
Yep. Oh, I remember.

00:49:56.440 --> 00:49:58.510
Lindsay was interested in me,

