A very sensitive subject for myself.

00:53:24.380 --> 00:53:25.817
Okay. For Gregg?

00:53:25.817 --> 00:53:26.650
Yeah.

00:53:26.650 --> 00:53:27.850
Okay. I didn't mean to bring up--

